   "HelpText_41_Title": "Echo System",
   "HelpText_420_Content": "[About] \nGreen and hazy as they may feel, school days always shine like gems in the river of memory. Those stories drift among the stars, your constant companions through every quiet night. \nAs the New Solar Celebration unfolds, fresh little tales begin to blossom between you and your friends...  \n\n[Eligibility] \nSolve the first riddle with Sigrika in Main Quest \"Gold Suspended in Shadows\" to unlock\n\n[Rules] \nProgress the Main Quest to unlock the events of the corresponding Resonators. Certain conditions are required to unlock some of the events. Complete \"Whispers Between Stars\" to earn exclusive rewards, including Astrites and a Livery.",
   "HelpText_420_Title": "Whispers Between Stars",
-  "HelpText_421_Content": "[About]\nHsin has arranged a task for Suoming, asking you to join her in recording the sights of the Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou. A trip \"down memory lane\" that draws out the long-sealed memories of the Ten Seals Covenant...\n\n[Eligibility]\nComplete Main Quest Chapter IV Act IV \"Simulacrum of the Heart: Epilogue\" to unlock.\n\n[Event Rules]\nExplore areas according to the clues to collect the scattered Chrono Traces.\nCollect all Chrono Traces to receive Astrites and other rewards.\nMore Chrono Traces will be available for collection in other areas in the future.",
+  "HelpText_421_Content": "Stay tuned",
   "HelpText_421_Title": "Dimmr Travelogue",
   "HelpText_422_Content": "[About]\nAfter a rift appeared at the entrance of Honami Crossing, many \"castaway\" objects from Lahai-Roi have begun surfacing across Honami. They have been transformed by the Sonoro into things familiar to the Left Behind. Namipon seems to have a way to restore the original messages hidden within these objects… Soon, the distant scenery of Lahai-Roi will unfold before you.\n\n\n[Eligibility]\nComplete Main Quest \"Flowing Starlight in the Iris.\"\n\n[Event Rules]\nOnce the event begins, Namipon will provide a new clue each day about a castaway object. Track down the correct object and uncover its hidden message to earn rewards.",
   "HelpText_422_Title": "Search for It! Bits of Lahai-Roi",
