-  "Skill_1006302_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets.",
+  "Skill_1006302_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nLily starts with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> by default. When <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>.",
   "Skill_1006302_SkillName": "Dream Blend",
-  "Skill_1006302_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006303_SkillDescribe": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumber</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151203>Cradle Lullaby</te></color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumber</color></size>\nLasts for 50s. While in <color=Highlight>Slumber</color>, Lily heals the active Resonator every 3s. During <color=Highlight>Slumber</color>, move to direct <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> pulls in targets within a certain range every 5s, and stops attacking 10s after movement stops. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Liberation again during <color=Highlight>Slumber</color> to end it early.\nDuring <color=Highlight>Slumber</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Slumber</color> keeps Lily on the field, and she takes no DMG while in <color=Highlight>Slumber</color>. Lily leaves the field when <color=Highlight>Slumber</color> ends, or earlier if she gets too far from the active Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nLasts for 25s. While this effect is active, each <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast by a Resonator in the team grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=151204>Dream Aroma</te></color>. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Aroma</color></size>\nEach stack increases the ATK of all Resonators in the team by 7%, stacking up to 4 times. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.",
+  "Skill_1006302_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006303_SkillDescribe": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151203>Cradle Lullaby</te></color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumber</color></size>\nLasts for 50s. When Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, she heals the nearby active Resonator every 3s. During <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, use directional input to command <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> pulls in targets within a certain range every 5s, and stops attacking 10s after movement stops. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Liberation again during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> to end it early.\nWhen Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> keeps Lily on the field, and she takes no DMG while in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>. Lily leaves the field when <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> ends, or earlier if she gets too far from the active Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nLasts for 25s. While this effect is active, each <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast by a Resonator in the team grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=151204>Dream Aroma</te></color>. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Aroma</color></size>\nEach stack increases the ATK of all Resonators in the team by 7%, stacking up to 4 times. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator or when <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> ends.",
   "Skill_1006303_SkillName": "Into the Dream Cradle",
-  "Skill_1006303_SkillResume": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumber</color> and grants <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> to all Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumber</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Slumber</color>, Lily continuously heals the active Resonator.\nDuring <color=Highlight>Slumber</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nWhile this effect is active, when the active Resonator casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, the ATK of all Resonators in the team is increased. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.",
+  "Skill_1006303_SkillResume": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> to all Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumberland</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, Lily continuously heals the active Resonator.\nDuring <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nWhile this effect is active, when the active Resonator casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, the ATK of all Resonators in the team is increased. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.",
   "Skill_1006304_SkillDescribe": "While casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, Lily additionally restores 6 points of Concerto Energy per second for 3s. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> additionally restores 10 points of Concerto Energy. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.",
   "Skill_1006304_SkillName": "Woven Scent",
-  "Skill_1006304_SkillResume": "While casting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, Lily additionally restores Concerto Energy every second.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.",
+  "Skill_1006304_SkillResume": "While casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, Lily additionally restores Concerto Energy every second.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.",
   "Skill_1006305_SkillDescribe": "While the active Resonator has 50% or more HP, Lily grants them 10% DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield equal to 10% of Lily's Max HP for 10s. This effect can be triggered once every 5 min.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nLasts for 60s. When a Resonator in the team takes DMG that brings their HP below 50% of their Max HP, they restore HP equal to 50% of their Max HP, and <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> is removed. This effect can be triggered once every 120s.",
   "Skill_1006305_SkillName": "Flowers for You",
-  "Skill_1006305_SkillResume": "While the active Resonator has high HP, Lily grants them DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes DMG and drops to very low HP, restore their HP.",
+  "Skill_1006305_SkillResume": "While the active Resonator has high HP, Lily grants them DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes DMG and drops to very low HP, restore their HP.",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color>, Lily's next Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillName": "Blooming Dream",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nWhile <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color> is active, Lily's Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing greater <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006307_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nLily can hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> on hit.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color> restores <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nLily consumes all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to pull in nearby targets, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>, and starts channeling. While channeling, she gains 10% DMG Reduction and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. She also continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and heals all Resonators in the team every second.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to consume all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nLily consumes all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> and starts channeling. While channeling, she continuously pulls in nearby targets and deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and heals all Resonators in the team every second.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to consume all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting this skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Silvered Dream</color></size>\nLasts for 30s.\nWhen the Resonator with this effect is the Active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, their ATK is increased by 5% for each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> the team has, counting up to 4 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color>.\nThe active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate is increased by 10%, and their Echo Skill Crit. DMG is increased by 25%.",
+  "Skill_1006307_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nLily can hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> on hit.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color> restores <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to pull in nearby targets, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. During the skill, she gains 10% DMG Reduction and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill. When <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to pull in nearby targets, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill. When <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting this skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 25s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Silvered Dream</color></size>\nLasts for 30s.\nWhen the Resonator with this effect is the Active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, their ATK is increased by 7% for each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> the team has, counting up to 4 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color>.\nThe active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate is increased by 10%, and their Echo Skill Crit. DMG is increased by 20%.\nAll nearby Resonators in the team gain resistance to interruption.",
